<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fighter Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Fighters' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name             Level   Up to
Club                 0   100%
Dagger               0   100%
Fist                 0   100%
Hand Axe             0   100%
Quarterstaff         0   100%
Whip                 0   80%
Rapier               1   100%
Short Sword          2   100%
Spear                2   100%
Kick Small           4   80%
Long Sword           4   100%
Mace                 4   100%
Scimitar             4   100%
War Hammer           8   100%
Brass Knuckles      10   100%
Morning Star        12   100%
Flail               14   100%
Battle Club         16   100%
Trident             16   80%
Bardiche            18   100%
Battle Mace         18   100%
Battle Axe          22   100%
War Mattock         25   100%
Halberd             30   100%
</pre>
